Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{=20}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:54.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[BOTH] Big Bro won!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.29,0:01:59.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B] Arlong Park has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:02.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:06.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nojiko... Is all of this\Nreally happening...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:09.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Surely this is a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:12.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.17,0:02:16.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] Luffy! Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:21.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.84,0:02:24.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good job Luffy! You almost\Ndid as good as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.38,0:02:26.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's face it I'm pretty much the star,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.21,0:02:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but I'll cheer for you anyway\Nbecause I'm super modest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.38,0:02:31.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I don't wanna steal\Nyour thunder! [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.02,0:02:34.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] You really had\Nus going there, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.39,0:02:36.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Start dealin' with\Nthe bad guys quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:39.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I almost had a heart attack...\NYou rubber jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.86,0:02:42.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.23,0:02:45.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:55.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.72,0:03:03.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:10.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughing]\NThis is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.63,0:03:12.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay! Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.14,0:03:25.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.98,0:03:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn! It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.15,0:03:30.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI laughs]\NWhat a lucky day today is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.99,0:03:32.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.06,0:03:34.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I saw the entire fight\Nand I must say, good work!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.56,0:03:38.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I can only assume that your victory\Nhere was some sort of bizarre accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.93,0:03:42.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}I never thought that the fishmen would\Nlose to riff-raff like you and your crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:45.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, now that Arlong\Nis out of the picture,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.50,0:03:48.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking all the money\NI was supposed to give to him
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,in addition to all the\Ntreasure in Arlong Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now drop your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.19,0:03:56.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Colonel Nezumi of Branch\N16 gets all the credit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.97,0:03:59.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.06,0:04:01.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:03.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see you're trying to rain\Non these people's parade...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.22,0:04:04.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now that's just plain rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:08.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:12.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] Go on you scum...\NJust try it...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.22,0:04:15.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll be sorry! I promise you that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.36,0:04:16.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] He's still talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.68,0:04:22.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is for shooting Nojiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.74,0:04:27.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And also for mercilessly destroying\NBellemere's tangerine orchard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.04,0:04:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.84,0:04:32.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Colonel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:37.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:42.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A thousand more and we'll call it even!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:46.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI gasping]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.52,0:04:48.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.31,0:04:51.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What you're gonna do is\Nclean up after those fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then you're gonna help to\Nrebuild the town of Gosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:57.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}And you won't lay finger on any\Nof the money or valuables in Arlong Park.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:04:59.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the island's money now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:00.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.42,0:05:02.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:04.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.39,0:05:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And there's one more thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.33,0:05:08.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give me my money back, jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:10.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I promise! I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.80,0:05:13.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll give every berry back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:19.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] I'll get you, you pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:22.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy is your Captain, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.51,0:05:25.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well mark my friggin'\Nwords, rubber man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:28.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Major things are gonna happen.\N'Cause you made me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:30.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I swear you'll regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.72,0:05:34.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'll get my revenge!\NJust you wait and see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:36.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Major things are gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:39.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Yeah, how does he know I'm\Ngonna be King of the Pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:42.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's not what he means at\Nall. Are you really that dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:44.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hold on! What next?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are we in super big trouble, or what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey! What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:49.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Hey, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.89,0:05:52.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time to\Nkeep this to ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:56.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We need to tell everyone on the\Nisland what happened here today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:06:00.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.13,0:06:02.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER C] Arlong Park has fallen!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:06.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hey, Zoro,\Nwhat's that on your chest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:07.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Made ya look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:08.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Quit it, ya jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:19.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good job, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.82,0:06:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To think...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.79,0:06:24.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Our island would be\Nsaved by unruly pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:26.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The world is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.76,0:06:43.42,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Well, Bellemere.\NWe finally made it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.23,0:06:46.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It took eight long years\Nbut we're finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.57,0:06:48.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The village... and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.43,0:06:52.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Why are you still here, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.25,0:06:52.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Your friends\Nhave been looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.35,0:07:01.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Hey, Nojiko. Genzo...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.45,0:07:05.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If Bellemere were still alive and\NI wanted to become a pirate do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.79,0:07:06.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,she'd let me do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.29,0:07:08.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A pirate...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:09.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.93,0:07:12.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course she'd never let her\Nprecious daughter go out to sea
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.56,0:07:13.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with a bunch of treacherous pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.97,0:07:15.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah, she'd let you!\N– [GENZO] Nojiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if she had said 'no,'
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.87,0:07:19.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that wouldn't stop you, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.43,0:07:23.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:26.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:27.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:31.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's up, Genzo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.42,0:07:38.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You certainty are\NBellemere's kids. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.03,0:07:39.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.10,0:07:43.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, you've already made\Nup your mind about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.87,0:07:48.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] There's no use\Nfighting it. Live your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.97,0:07:54.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's still at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:56.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.62,0:07:59.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Well, you saw the way\Nhe looked after that fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.95,0:08:03.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Yeah, anyone\Nelse would've been dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.21,0:08:05.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groaning]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:06.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.55,0:08:10.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Did you think this\Nwould heal on its own?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously, pirates are supposed\Nbe smarter than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:14.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO groans]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:16.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Don't you have a ship's doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:17.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:19.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Never thought of that. Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:20.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:22.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we need to get a\Nmusician first, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:23.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.78,0:08:25.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Because pirates really like to sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:28.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's true, but why's that first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:29.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NEZUMI] Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.46,0:08:30.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hello?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.59,0:08:32.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A] Yes.\NThis is Navy Headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.09,0:08:35.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[NEZUMI] Headquarters!\NRight! Good! Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.06,0:08:38.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is Colonel Nezumi\Nof Marine Branch 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:41.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Marine Code 00733!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.97,0:08:43.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I have a request!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:45.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}There really is no reason\Nto shout. I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:48.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen! There's a pirate\Nwho wears a straw hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.71,0:08:49.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's named Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.71,0:08:52.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Listen! There's a pirate\Nwho wears a straw hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.13,0:08:53.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I hereby declare that he
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:53.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}He's named Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.74,0:08:58.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and his four crewmembers are\Nenemies of the government!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:09:03.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2}I hereby declare that he and his four\Ncrewmembers are enemies of the government!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:04.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Luffy... Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.13,0:09:06.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NEZUMI] They managed to take down
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.34,0:09:10.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the purportedly invincible\Nfishman Arlong at his home base.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.17,0:09:12.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Based on the grave threat\Nthey present a large bounty
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.04,0:09:16.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,has been placed on their\Ncaptain, Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:18.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Transmitting photograph now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.02,0:09:19.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:23.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[MARINE B] Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have taken\Na better picture than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.53,0:09:28.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No... Sorry sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.34,0:09:31.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[TRANSPONDER SNAIL A] Okay, right\Nafter a quick verification,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:33.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll send it in for approval, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:34.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.95,0:09:37.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, he's a wanted\Npirate! Dead or alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.89,0:09:43.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I want his face on posters\Nall over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.92,0:09:58.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Boy am I stuffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.12,0:10:01.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nice to not have\Nto cook for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.06,0:10:02.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, how're you feelin', Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:04.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:06.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think all I need's\Na little bit a rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.30,0:10:07.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.94,0:10:10.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Seriously, how much\Nlonger can they keep this up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.94,0:10:12.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's been three days now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.97,0:10:15.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nothing wrong with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.61,0:10:18.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Smoke 'em if ya got 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.98,0:10:20.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hey, Sanji...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:23.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that melon you\Nhad. I want to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It isn't polite to talk\Nwith your mouth full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:26.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] I dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.67,0:10:29.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a raw ham melon\Nwith raw ham on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.40,0:10:31.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Raw ham melon?!\NShow me where you found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.01,0:10:32.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.24,0:10:36.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The whole town is basically\None giant buffet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Good luck finding it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:40.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He ran off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:43.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Three days of stuffing his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:47.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And now that my belly's\Nfull. Time to dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:48.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,With the ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.94,0:10:50.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] I am Captain Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.91,0:10:56.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I destroyed the strongest\Nof all the fishmen!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.05,0:11:01.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's sing about me, let's sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:03.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)}♪ I am the greatest, my friends. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:05.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(150,150)}♪ Oh, I'm the best that you see. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:08.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.94,0:11:07.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm so bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.05,0:11:10.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be more upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.42,0:11:12.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why didn't this happen\Nbefore my daddy died?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.62,0:11:14.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why is life so unfair?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.09,0:11:15.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.92,0:11:19.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was kinda upset, at first...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:22.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But I decided just to\Nthink about my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:23.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.71,0:11:28.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[CHABO] We were saved by the\Nstraw hat guy and his friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:32.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}But tomorrow we have to start all over again,\Non our own, without anybody's help.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:39.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}We can't forget the past... but... now...\Nit's... really up to us what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.31,0:11:41.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no one to blame\Nour problems on anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.55,0:11:43.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can succeed or fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:44.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It all depends on our choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:48.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whining about the past gets us nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.19,0:11:51.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I decided to think that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:53.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.30,0:11:57.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop, ow, ow, let go, stop\Nthat hurts, ow, stop ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.26,0:12:00.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's no fun if I can't harass\Nyou for being a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.40,0:12:02.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you decided to hurt me instead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You stupid old punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:09.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:11.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Punk... That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:16.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Can you get rid of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.07,0:12:21.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But you do realize this is a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.42,0:12:24.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Heh. I was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.62,0:12:27.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I knew it wouldn't come off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.66,0:12:31.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI cries] I don't\Nwant anyone to see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:34.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This... This awful tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.93,0:12:40.57,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm just pretending but\Nit's like he owns me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.36,0:12:43.58,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.26,0:12:48.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Nojiko, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:50.21,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Oh, you mean this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.37,0:12:53.71,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's nothing, just a tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.01,0:12:56.55,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Now I look just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.55,0:12:59.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[BOTH laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.76,0:13:02.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Hey, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:03.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Mm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.06,0:13:06.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I think I'd like a new tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:07.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:11.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS chattering, laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:12.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8}[USOPP] ♪ La... La...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.60,0:13:13.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,On to Captain Usopp song. Number 185.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:15.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's stand as we sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.03,0:13:23.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Bellemere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.60,0:13:25.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Your daughters are\Nstrong young women now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.70,0:13:26.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'd be so proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:30.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm standing\Nright in front of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.21,0:13:34.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] We're not going to\Nwaste a single moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.04,0:13:35.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So much has been lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.95,0:13:38.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone has had to make\Nterrible sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.75,0:13:41.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Which is why I don't care\Nif I look like a fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.28,0:13:44.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for the first\Ntime in a long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.18,0:13:48.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Raw ham melon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:52.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wha...? There's no food up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.21,0:13:53.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll go back Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:57.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] A grave? Did somebody die?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.46,0:14:00.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Yes. A long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.16,0:14:02.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.77,0:14:05.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I give you to my conveniences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.67,0:14:08.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait, my sincere compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.44,0:14:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nope... My darkest concussion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.44,0:14:12.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] My deepest condolences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:14.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.63,0:14:15.75,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Listen, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:18.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I know Nami's going away with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.60,0:14:22.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}She has her mind set on becoming a pirate,\Nand that's dangerous business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:27.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And I'm fine with that.\NIt can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.46,0:14:33.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But if any of you ever do anything\Nto hurt her, I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.96,0:14:36.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] We're not going to hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.63,0:14:38.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.64,0:14:40.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:53.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] This is the last one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.97,0:14:54.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.64,0:14:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] We got everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.01,0:14:57.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:59.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright. We're stocked up\Nwith everything we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.98,0:15:01.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I think we're good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:04.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP grunts] You know we've\Nonly been on this little island
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:06.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,for a few days but it feels\Nmore like a lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.68,0:15:09.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah! [laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.23,0:15:10.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.83,0:15:18.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't thank you enough for\Neverything you've done for us,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.09,0:15:21.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,but we gotta go back to our\Nregular jobs as bounty hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.60,0:15:22.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, this is goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:26.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hope we get to meet again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.21,0:15:28.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,See ya 'round.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.98,0:15:30.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[JOHNNY, YOSAKU] Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.31,0:15:32.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now it's time\Nfor us to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.83,0:15:34.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:36.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But we can't leave yet...\Nwe gotta wait for Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:38.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, maybe she's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Uhh. What, why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.05,0:15:44.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}If you try to hit on her again, I swear\NI'll break your freakin' neck! You got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.82,0:15:46.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why would I do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.03,0:15:47.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] She might not even be coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.43,0:15:49.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,After all, she has achieved her goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.21,0:15:51.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami doesn't have to\Nbe a pirate anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.21,0:15:53.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She might be better off if she\Nstayed here on this island
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.45,0:15:55.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,with all her friends and family.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.14,0:15:56.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What about me, dammit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.00,0:16:00.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Without Nami onboard I have\Nlike 98.72% less reason
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.98,0:16:03.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,to stay with you people\Non this stupid pirate ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.48,0:16:06.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm still upset with you\Nabout the raw ham melon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:08.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:09.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.37,0:16:11.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen her anywhere\Nsince this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:12.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:14.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,One hundred million berries?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.15,0:16:16.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She left all of it in\Nour house with a letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.39,0:16:18.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's not even gonna take some of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.85,0:16:21.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But she worked so hard to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:23.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She'll steal more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.13,0:16:24.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's what her letter said.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.80,0:16:28.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no changing her\Nmind once it's made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.00,0:16:30.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.29,0:16:33.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She didn't even give us\Na chance to thank her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.97,0:16:34.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:35.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[USOPP, ZORO gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.72,0:16:36.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI screams]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:38.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[ALL] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.63,0:16:40.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] There she is!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.23,0:16:40.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.12,0:16:41.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.93,0:16:45.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Set the sails!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:46.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.79,0:16:53.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I don't get it. Why's she running?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.98,0:16:55.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] She said to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.41,0:16:55.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.62,0:17:02.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,{\q2}No, she's planning on leaving us without\Nletting any of us thank her or say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:03.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.56,0:17:05.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Set sail
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.49,0:17:12.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Wait! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.82,0:17:13.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B] They're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.79,0:17:16.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Stop!\NAt least let us say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:19.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Nami, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:22.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B] Let us thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.05,0:17:26.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami! Come back here\Nyou can't leave this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.62,0:17:29.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, you sure you want\Nto let her leave like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not my decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.99,0:17:32.32,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She does what she wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:34.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.49,0:17:49.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:51.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGERS] Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:02.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.36,0:18:24.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh?! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.63,0:18:25.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER A] Hey, where's my money?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:26.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER B] My wallet's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:28.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER C] Mine, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:29.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER D] She stole my money!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:32.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[VILLAGER AA] My purse is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.58,0:18:41.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn! You little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.50,0:18:45.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Great, she hasn't changed a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'd watch my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.27,0:18:51.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY, SANJI laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:55.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] You lousy pickpocket!\NWe'll miss you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:02.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.18,0:19:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:07.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Remember what I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.62,0:19:11.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:15.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] Goodbye everybody!\NI'll miss you. Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:20.06,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[NOJIKO laughing]\NI can't believe her!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:22.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My little sister got\Nus good with that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:25.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Be safe, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.06,0:19:29.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO laughs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.75,0:19:31.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.52,0:19:34.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] What is it Doc... Nami's bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.12,0:19:38.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] Not exactly.\NThat girl will never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:39.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's her new tattoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.21,0:19:41.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] What's it supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:45.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[DOCTOR] A tangerine... and a pinwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.72,0:19:48.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Genzo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.22,0:19:49.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where's your pinwheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.76,0:19:56.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO laughs]\NI don't need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.31,0:20:08.94,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,[NAMI] I'm off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.44,0:20:15.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[baby cries]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.27,0:20:19.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Genzo, back off.\NDon't get so close to Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.71,0:20:22.66,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] I just wanted to see her smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.68,0:20:26.20,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] Your face is\Ntoo scary. It's making her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.89,0:20:29.88,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[GENZO] I can't change\Nmy face... Oh, wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:33.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll keep this on my\Nhat to distract her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:35.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What do ya think little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.90,0:20:37.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.43,0:20:38.76,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It's just a stupid pinwheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.77,0:20:40.26,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no way it's going to make her...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.26,0:20:43.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,[laughing]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.17,0:20:51.06,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,[BELLEMERE] I can't\Nbelieve it. She's laughing.
